  "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>What you notice first says a lot about you. Was it the blue skin or the four arms? This Race is traditionally offered to female crawlers, but some male Tetrakai have been spotted--literally. Male Tetrakai have white polka-dot spots the size of poker chips. Now you know why you don't see many.</p><p>As you can imagine, having four arms is pretty nice, though I don't know what the males do with the other three. Holding four items at a time offers all sorts of juicy benefits. Too bad you don't have four actions, amirite?</p><ul><li>Size: Medium (4)</li><li>+6 Dexterity</li><li>-2 Charisma</li><li>+2 Pugilism and Wrasslin' Skills</li><li>+1 in all Edged Weapon Skills</li><li>Four Arms: Your Hands/Holding Gear slot allows for four items (or two weapons requiring two hands)</li></ul><p><strong>Primal variant</strong> (Race &amp; Class Selection, p.128): this Race's own benefits above, plus the Primal modifiers layered on top - -1 to all Stats (already included in the Change list below), and all Skills can be raised to Rank 20 (already true system-wide - see docs/known-gaps.md).</p>",
